Description: 100% local AI assistant for the Linux desktop
 openTARS is an AI assistant that runs entirely on your machine (through
 Ollama), with no cloud. It understands requests in Portuguese, English,
 Spanish, French and German and controls the desktop: opens and closes
 apps, clicks buttons by name, types, searches the web, looks at the screen
 and runs terminal commands.
 .
 It adapts to whatever AI models you already have in Ollama, picking the
 best one for each kind of task. Comes with a window ("opentars-gui"), a
 quick bar opened by a global shortcut ("opentars-gui --rapido") and a
 terminal mode ("opentars").
